Laura Stephans<\/h3><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><div id=\"pg-w663883ba09a34-3\"  class=\"panel-grid panel-no-style\" ><div id=\"pgc-w663883ba09a34-3-0\"  class=\"panel-grid-cell panel-grid-cell-mobile-last\" ><div id=\"panel-w663883ba09a34-3-0-0\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_sow-image panel-first-child panel-last-child widgetopts-SO\" data-index=\"5\" ><div\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tclass=\"so-widget-sow-image so-widget-sow-image-default-c67d20f9f743\"\n\t\t\t\n\t\t>\n<div class=\"sow-image-container\">\n\t\t<img \n\tdata-src=\"https:\/\/francomunoz.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/daniel-1.jpg\" width=\"152\" height=\"153\" data-srcset=\"https:\/\/francomunoz.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/daniel-1.jpg 152w, https:\/\/francomunoz.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/daniel-1-150x150.jpg 150w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 152px) 100vw, 152px\" title=\"Daniel Alvarez\" alt=\"\" \t\tclass=\"so-widget-image lazyload\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 152px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 152\/153;\" \/>\n\t<\/div>\n\n<h3 class=\"widget-title\">Daniel Alvarez<\/h3><\/div><\/div><\/div><div id=\"pgc-w663883ba09a34-3-1\"  class=\"panel-grid-cell panel-grid-cell-empty\" ><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><div id=\"pg-1625-2\"  class=\"panel-grid panel-no-style\" ><div id=\"pgc-1625-2-0\"  class=\"panel-grid-cell\" ><div id=\"panel-1625-2-0-0\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_sow-image panel-first-child widgetopts-SO\" data-index=\"4\" ><div\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tclass=\"so-widget-sow-image so-widget-sow-image-default-c67d20f9f743-1625\"\n\t\t\t\n\t\t>\n<div class=\"sow-image-container\">\n\t\t<img \n\tdata-src=\"https:\/\/francomunoz.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/San-Francisco-office-person.jpg\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" data-srcset=\"https:\/\/francomunoz.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/San-Francisco-office-person.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/francomunoz.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/San-Francisco-office-person-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\/\/francomunoz.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/San-Francisco-office-person-150x150.jpg 150w, https:\/\/francomunoz.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/San-Francisco-office-person-768x768.jpg 768w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" title=\"San Francisco office person\" alt=\"\" \t\tclass=\"so-widget-image lazyload\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 1024px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 1024\/1024;\" \/>\n\t<\/div>\n\n<\/div><\/div><div id=\"panel-1625-2-0-1\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_black-studio-tinymce widget_black_studio_tinymce panel-last-child widgetopts-SO\" data-index=\"5\" ><div class=\"panel-widget-style panel-widget-style-for-1625-2-0-1\" ><div class=\"textwidget\"><h3><b>Entendiendo la Compensaci\u00f3n Laboral en San Francisco<\/b><b><\/b><\/h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">San Francisco es una ciudad \u00fanica con industrias diversas y una fuerza laboral que incluye profesionales de la tecnolog\u00eda, personal de restaurantes, trabajadores de la construcci\u00f3n y proveedores de atenci\u00f3n m\u00e9dica. En Franco Mu\u00f1oz, lo hemos visto todo y estamos aqu\u00ed para ayudarte a navegar por las complejidades de presentar un reclamo de compensaci\u00f3n laboral en San Francisco.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><b>Esto es lo que debes hacer si te lesionas en el trabajo:<\/b><\/p>\n<ol>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Informa tu Lesi\u00f3n Inmediatamente:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Notifica a tu empleador sobre tu lesi\u00f3n laboral lo antes posible. Este es el primer paso para proteger tus derechos.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Busca Atenci\u00f3n M\u00e9dica:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Obt\u00e9n atenci\u00f3n m\u00e9dica de manera inmediata. San Francisco cuenta con una amplia gama de instalaciones m\u00e9dicas de primer nivel, y podemos ayudarte a encontrar un proveedor especializado en lesiones relacionadas con el trabajo.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Presenta tu Reclamo:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Te ayudaremos a completar los formularios necesarios, incluido el formulario DWC-1, para presentar oficialmente tu reclamo.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Investigaci\u00f3n del Caso:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Reunimos evidencia e informes m\u00e9dicos para construir un caso s\u00f3lido que garantice el m\u00e1ximo de beneficios.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Recibe tus Beneficios:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Si tu reclamo es aprobado, recibir\u00e1s compensaci\u00f3n por gastos m\u00e9dicos, salarios perdidos y cualquier discapacidad permanente.<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><div id=\"pg-1625-3\"  class=\"panel-grid panel-has-style\" ><div id=\"home-it-works\" class=\"panel-row-style panel-row-style-for-1625-3\" ><div id=\"pgc-1625-3-0\"  class=\"panel-grid-cell\" ><div id=\"panel-1625-3-0-0\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_siteorigin-panels-builder panel-first-child panel-last-child widgetopts-SO\" data-index=\"6\" ><div id=\"pl-w663f22f075e07\"  class=\"panel-layout\" ><div id=\"pg-w663f22f075e07-0\"  class=\"panel-grid panel-no-style\" ><div id=\"pgc-w663f22f075e07-0-0\"  class=\"panel-grid-cell\" ><div id=\"panel-w663f22f075e07-0-0-0\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_sow-editor panel-first-child panel-last-child widgetopts-SO\" data-index=\"0\" ><div class=\"heading panel-widget-style panel-widget-style-for-w663f22f075e07-0-0-0\" ><div\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tclass=\"so-widget-sow-editor so-widget-sow-editor-base\"\n\t\t\t\n\t\t>\n<div class=\"siteorigin-widget-tinymce textwidget\">\n\t<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">C\u00d3MO FUNCIONA<\/h2>\n<h4 style=\"text-align: center;\">Franco Mu\u00f1oz Law, los principales abogados de compensaci\u00f3n laboral de California, simplifican el proceso como 1-2-3.<\/h4>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><div id=\"pg-w663f22f075e07-1\"  class=\"panel-grid panel-no-style\" ><div id=\"pgc-w663f22f075e07-1-0\"  class=\"panel-grid-cell\" ><div id=\"panel-w663f22f075e07-1-0-0\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_sow-editor panel-first-child panel-last-child widgetopts-SO\" data-index=\"1\" ><div\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tclass=\"so-widget-sow-editor so-widget-sow-editor-base\"\n\t\t\t\n\t\t>\n<div class=\"siteorigin-widget-tinymce textwidget\">\n\t<p><script src=\"https:\/\/fast.wistia.com\/embed\/medias\/s6josxaq5k.jsonp\" async><\/script><script src=\"https:\/\/fast.wistia.com\/assets\/external\/E-v1.js\" async><\/script><\/p>\n<div class=\"wistia_responsive_padding\" style=\"padding:56.25% 0 0 0;position:relative;\">\n<div class=\"wistia_responsive_wrapper\" style=\"height:100%;left:0;position:absolute;top:0;width:100%;\"><span class=\"wistia_embed wistia_async_s6josxaq5k popover=true videoFoam=true\" style=\"display:inline-block;height:100%;position:relative;width:100%\">&nbsp;<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><div id=\"pgc-w663f22f075e07-1-1\"  class=\"panel-grid-cell\" ><div id=\"panel-w663f22f075e07-1-1-0\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_siteorigin-panels-builder panel-first-child panel-last-child widgetopts-SO\" data-index=\"2\" ><div id=\"how-works-steps\" class=\"panel-widget-style panel-widget-style-for-w663f22f075e07-1-1-0\" ><div id=\"pl-w663f22f075e2d\"  class=\"panel-layout\" ><div id=\"pg-w663f22f075e2d-0\"  class=\"panel-grid panel-no-style\" ><div id=\"pgc-w663f22f075e2d-0-0\"  class=\"panel-grid-cell\" ><div id=\"panel-w663f22f075e2d-0-0-0\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_sow-editor panel-first-child panel-last-child widgetopts-SO\" data-index=\"0\" ><div class=\"numbers-increment panel-widge